  "reply": "Outside Your Tent\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "w",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 72,
  "parentBeforeName": "Outside Your Tent",
  "parentAfter": 73,
  "parentAfterName": "Near the Nile",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "Near the Nile\nYou are on an east/west path on the north side of the encampment. A path to the south starts here, and you can see the riverbank clearly to the west. A warm, light breeze reaches your face, drying your sweat into a thin mask of salt. You glance to the north and are greeted by a disheartening sight: an endless stretch of searing desert. There's an enlarged hole in the sand, a remnant of your excavation attempts.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "w",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 73,
  "parentBeforeName": "Near the Nile",
  "parentAfter": 82,
  "parentAfterName": "River Bank",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "River Bank\nYou are on the bank of the river Nile. The shoreline is sandy and cool, and reeds wave in a light but warm breeze. Directly to the north and the south thickets make strolling along the bank impossible. You're hot, and the cool rippling water to the west looks inviting, but you're not alone in that thought -- crocodiles bask on the west bank, eyeing you hungrily, just waiting for you to enter their watery domain. Things were never like this when Craige was around.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "drink water",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 82,
  "parentBeforeName": "River Bank",
  "parentAfter": 82,
  "parentAfterName": "River Bank",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "You kneel down and drink deeply from the Nile and feel refreshed.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "drop knapsack",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 82,
  "parentBeforeName": "River Bank",
  "parentAfter": 82,
  "parentAfterName": "River Bank",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "You take the knapsack off and place it down. As it settles, the cover flaps open.\n \n>"
 },
