  "parentBefore": 72,
  "parentBeforeName": "Outside Your Tent",
  "parentAfter": 70,
  "parentAfterName": "Northern Path",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "Northern Path\nYou are on an east/west path on the northern side of the encampment. To the east you can see the sites of previous excavations your workers had begun before they deserted you. Low, gentle sand dunes roll out of sight to the north, but your camp's eastern border has a path, heading off to the south, which starts here. There's a small hole in the sand, a remnant of your excavation attempts.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "se",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 70,
  "parentBeforeName": "Northern Path",
  "parentAfter": 58,
  "parentAfterName": "Desert",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "Desert\nYou are in the desert, still within sight of the encampment, just a tiny oasis to the west. The tents, shimmering behind the heat waves rising from the sand, seem to be calling you back, beckoning, offering safety and refuge. There's a small hole in the sand, a remnant of your excavation attempts.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "se",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 58,
  "parentBeforeName": "Desert",
  "parentAfter": 54,
  "parentAfterName": "Desert",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "Desert\nYou are in the desert, out of sight of the encampment. You are thankful there's no wind, even though a cooling breeze would be welcomed, since the fine sand particles would sting your face and hands. All around is the desert, a sweeping expanse of disheartening sand. There's a small hole in the sand, a remnant of your excavation attempts.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "dig in sand",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 54,
  "parentBeforeName": "Desert",
  "parentAfter": 54,
  "parentAfterName": "Desert",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "(with the shovel)\nYou've enlarged the hole a little, taking out two shovelsfull for every one that collapses back in from the walls.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "dig in sand",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 54,
  "parentBeforeName": "Desert",
  "parentAfter": 54,
  "parentAfterName": "Desert",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "(with the shovel)\nYou've made the hole quite sizable, though it's not very deep. The deeper you dig, the more the walls collapse and so you widen the base of the hole.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "dig in sand",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 54,
  "parentBeforeName": "Desert",
  "parentAfter": 54,
  "parentAfterName": "Desert",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "(with the shovel)\nYou're knee-deep in the hole, digging away, taking out more and more sand. You silently curse those workers for having deserted you.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "dig in sand",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 54,
  "parentBeforeName": "Desert",
  "parentAfter": 54,
  "parentAfterName": "Desert",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "(with the shovel)\nYou've dug yourself into a deep hole. You're actually several feet below the surrounding sand. The walls look very unstable.\n \n>"
 },
 {
  "cmd": "dig in sand",
  "tag": null,
  "parentBefore": 54,
  "parentBeforeName": "Desert",
  "parentAfter": 54,
  "parentAfterName": "Desert",
  "playerId": 223,
  "reply": "(with the shovel)\nYou've uncovered what could only be the top of a pyramid. After clearing it away with your hands, you notice a square opening in the top of it.\n \n>"
 },
